  "details": "From time to time gestures break for me. This has been going on for a while. I'm currently on the beta branch. But this has been happening for me on and off for a while in both stable and betas.\n\nSometimes GestureLeft and GestureRight stop working. It doesn't matter what avatar I use. I can swap to avatars in the public row and have the same problem. In debug they stay at 0 and my gesture overlay doesn't change. Other people can't see my gestures either.\n\nThis time I noticed it while being in Super VR Ball. And it seemed to have been fixed after swapping worlds.\n\nIt seems like this old post from 2022 has the same problem: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/gestures-break-randomly\n\nLogs: https://gist.github.com/Tummy-git/0938fbf9fa3c28614a912717d1311fde\n\nSorry, I wish I had a way to recreate this and that I put this in the right category.",
